  "root_cause": "Torch couples torch.set_float32_matmul_precision() to torch.backends.cuda.matmul.allow_tf32. Restoring the public precision before the low-level CUDA flag allowed a later allow_tf32=True assignment to rewrite a caller-owned medium policy to high. The test and H100 helper repeated the same incorrect construction order and therefore never created an observable medium caller state.",
